Final implementation checkpoint for native scene and resource integration.

Delivered
- Protocol v2 with strict integration metadata models and a versioned preflight result.
- Bundled Godot preflight that reads suite INTEGRATION constants through Godot metadata, validates paths, modes, fields, and override targets, and merges defaults with per-test overrides field by field. Python never parses GDScript.
- Mode-aware orchestration: headless by default, windowed suites run without --headless and fail with exit 2 when no display exists.
- GdToolsTestContext for scene root, relative and glob node lookup, named resources, effective metadata, bounded signal waits, and atomic screenshot capture, plus per-attempt scene/context/resource setup and teardown with retry isolation and cleanup-failure classification.
- Run-scoped artifacts under .gd-tools/artifacts/<run_id>/ with a machine-readable index, published atomically before older runs are pruned, including preflight-failure indexes.
- Reporting, doctor, init, and packaging alignment: infrastructure failures report before exiting, JUnit carries the artifact index, init deploys all five managed addon scripts, and doctor verifies them.

