- Headless and display-capable Godot E2E included in the run; windowed screenshot capture verified on a real display.
- Wheel build verified to bundle all five native addon scripts.
- No new runtime dependency and no new CLI flag or configuration key: pyproject.toml and config.py are unchanged since the track base.
